%rec: Location
%doc: Places where discs are kept: site, room, shelf, box. Parent makes a tree,
+ so moving a box moves every disc in it. A Disc's Location field (one per
+ place its copies are kept) names a Code here, or is free text.
%key: Code
%mandatory: Code Name

Code: HOME
Name: Home

Code: STUDY
Name: Study
Parent: HOME

Code: BOX1
Name: Box 1, blue lid
Parent: STUDY

Code: SAFE
Name: Fire safe
Parent: HOME

Code: OFFSITE
Name: Parents' house

%rec: Event
%doc: Preservation actions. Type uses the PREMIS eventType vocabulary:
+ https://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/preservation/eventType
%mandatory: Disc Type Date Outcome
%type: Outcome enum success failure warning

